; t09 weave: non-fanout DAG, multi-input tasks, fanout with broadcast input
; 1. plain DAG, multi-input task
weave
  task a:
    ret 1 2 add
  task b:
    ret 10 20 add
  task c: a! b!
    ret a@ b@ add
run
print

; 2. fanout: first input drives, second input broadcast
weave
  task items:
    ret 1 6 range
  task base:
    ret 100
  4 task work: items! base!
    ret items@ base@ add
run work
results!
results@ length print
results@ sort results!
results@ 0 get print
results@ 4 get print
